### REST Client examples for six-cities
@host = http://localhost:3000

### --- Auth ---

### Register
POST {{host}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test-user@example.com",
  "password": "qwerty1",
  "type": "pro"
}

### Login (capture token from response.body.token)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test-user@example.com",
  "password": "qwerty1"
}

### Convenience variable that grabs the token from the login response above.
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Check authentication (returns current user profile)
GET {{host}}/users/login
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (JWT: client must additionally discard the token)
DELETE {{host}}/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload avatar for the authenticated user
POST {{host}}/users/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar-sample.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./mocks/avatar-sample.png
------boundary--


### --- Offers ---

### List all offers (anonymous → isFavorite always false)
GET {{host}}/offers

### List as authenticated user → isFavorite respects user's favorites
GET {{host}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Premium offers in a city
GET {{host}}/offers/premium/Amsterdam

### Get one offer
GET {{host}}/offers/REPLACE_WITH_OFFER_ID

### Create an offer (host is taken from the token, never from the body)
# @name newOffer
POST {{host}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Beautiful apartment in the heart of Paris",
  "description": "Spacious and renovated apartment with a great view on the river.",
  "city": "Paris",
  "previewImage": "img/apartment-01.jpg",
  "images": [
    "img/01.jpg", "img/02.jpg", "img/03.jpg",
    "img/04.jpg", "img/05.jpg", "img/06.jpg"
  ],
  "isPremium": true,
  "type": "apartment",
  "bedrooms": 2,
  "maxAdults": 4,
  "price": 300,
  "goods": ["Breakfast", "Towels"],
  "location": {
    "latitude": 48.85661,
    "longitude": 2.351499
  }
}

@createdOfferId = {{newOffer.response.body.id}}

### Update an offer (only the owner can do it)
PATCH {{host}}/offers/{{createdOfferId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title",
  "price": 280
}

### Delete an offer (only the owner can do it)
DELETE {{host}}/offers/{{createdOfferId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### --- Comments ---

### Comments for an offer (public)
GET {{host}}/offers/REPLACE_WITH_OFFER_ID/comments

### Post a comment (author is taken from the token)
POST {{host}}/offers/REPLACE_WITH_OFFER_ID/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Great place, would book again!",
  "rating": 5
}


### --- Favorites (all require auth) ---

### List my favorites
GET {{host}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add to favorites
POST {{host}}/favorites/REPLACE_WITH_OFFER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove from favorites
DELETE {{host}}/favorites/REPLACE_WITH_OFFER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
